### Trading API Test Requests
### Sử dụng file này với REST Client extension trong VS Code hoặc IntelliJ

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5299
@token = YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### ============================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION
### ============================================

### Login để lấy token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "your-email@example.com",
  "password": "YourPassword123!"
}

### Sau khi login, copy accessToken từ response và paste vào biến @token ở trên
### Ví dụ: @token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### ============================================
### CÁCH SỬ DỤNG TOKEN TRONG AUTHORIZATION HEADER:
### ============================================
### 
### Option 1: Sử dụng biến @token (tự động thêm "Bearer ")
### Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### 
### Option 2: Copy trực tiếp token vào Value field trong Swagger/Postman:
### Value: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
### 
### LƯU Ý: Phải có từ "Bearer" + khoảng trắng + token
### Format: Bearer {your_access_token}
### 
### Ví dụ với token thực tế:
### Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..ix0Xq5WAJPNiDVnb-L_aAx8Cgdh4yazGO5C8iA_xiJo
### ============================================

### ============================================
### 2. BALANCES
### ============================================

### Get Wallet Balances
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trading/balances
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 3. DASHBOARD
### ============================================

### Get Dashboard Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trading/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Full Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trading/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 4. ORDERS
### ============================================

### Place Market Order (BUY BTC)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trading/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "BTC/USD",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "quantity": 0.01
}

### Place Limit Order (BUY BTC)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trading/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "BTC/USD",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "quantity": 0.1,
  "price": 60000.00
}

### Place Limit Order (SELL ETH)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trading/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "ETH/USD",
  "side": "SELL",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "quantity": 1.0,
  "price": 3500.00
}

### Get All Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trading/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Open Orders Only (multiple status values)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trading/orders?status=NEW&status=PARTIAL
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Orders with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trading/orders?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Order by ID (thay {orderId} bằng ID thực tế)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trading/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel Order (thay {orderId} bằng ID thực tế)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/trading/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 5. ORDER BOOK
### ============================================

### Get Order Book for BTC (query string format)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trading/orderbook?symbol=BTC/USD
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Order Book for BTC (path parameter format)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trading/orderbook/BTC-USD
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Order Book for ETH with custom depth
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trading/orderbook?symbol=ETH/USD&depth=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 6. TRADE HISTORY
### ============================================

### Get Trade History (uses same query params as /trades)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trading/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Trade History with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trading/history?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Trade History with Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trading/history?symbol=BTC/USD&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### 7. HOLDINGS & PORTFOLIO
### ============================================

### Get Holdings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trading/holdings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### NOTES:
### 1. Thay YOUR_TOKEN_HERE bằng token từ login response
### 2. Đảm bảo port đúng (5299 hoặc port khác từ dotnet run)
### 3. Đảm bảo đã seed wallet balance trước khi test orders
### 4. Symbol phải match với Cryptocurrencies trong DB (BTC/USD, ETH/USD)
### ============================================

